{% endfor %}{% else %}Nothing is circulating yet. The `duplicate` verdict cannot apply.
{% endif %}
## Context
- Remembered by: {{ source_owner }}
{% if length(source_location) > 0 -%}
- Where: {{ source_location }}
{% endif -%}
- How strongly it stuck with them: {% if importance >= 0.9 %}They will carry this to their grave. It is one of the few events that defines their life, and they will still be telling it when they are old.{% else if importance >= 0.8 %}They have not been the same since. Weeks on it still finds them at night, and their voice changes when they speak of it.{% else if importance >= 0.7 %}It matters to them. They think about it often and would raise it themselves without being asked.{% else if importance >= 0.6 %}It stayed with them. They would bring it up over a drink and tell it properly, rather than in passing.{% else if importance >= 0.5 %}They remember it clearly and would mention it if the conversation wandered near it.{% else if importance >= 0.4 %}It registered. They could recount it if asked directly, though they would not raise it themselves.{% else if importance >= 0.3 %}A small thing. They remember that it happened rather better than they remember what happened.{% else if importance >= 0.2 %}Barely held onto. They would need reminding before it came back to them at all.{% else if importance >= 0.1 %}It made almost no impression: another unremarkable hour of an unremarkable day.{% else %}It left no mark whatsoever. They would never think to mention it to anyone.{% endif %}

Decide: would {{ source_owner }} tell the world, is it already going round,
and would anyone listen? Then answer with one verdict.
[ end user ]
